{
    "name": "jpynb1",
    "title": "jpynb1: Printing Basics",
    "summary": "A tiny practice lesson that mirrors the structure of a Kaggle Learn exercise notebook.",
    "introduction": [
        "In this lesson you will complete two short exercises.",
        "Each exercise asks you to print the exact expected message, then verify the result with the matching `q*.check()` helper.",
